# Grave Concerns (sandoria 11) with a full inventory at each give: 541 taken (the skin cannot be given: not begun);
# accepted by GM: the Tombstone's 2 (no skin, no waterskin: Dropped 1) finished full (no waterskin), then with room
# (the waterskin); a Well full (the waterskin traded: the skin cannot be given, nothing taken), then with room; the
# Tombstone full (the skin traded: the waterskin cannot be given: nil, OfferingWaterOK stays 0), then with room; 624
# finished full (no item in the reward: completed anyway, the waterskin taken).
lists SouthernSanDoria/Andecia/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Andecia/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/Well/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/541 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/624 KingRanperresTomb/Tombstone_Upper/onTrigger KingRanperresTomb/Tombstone_Upper/onTrade KingRanperresTomb/onEventFinish/2
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=171.1,-0.9,45.0 job=WAR lvl=30
charvar Quest[0][11]Introduction 1
login
fill-inventory
trigger Andecia                           # Introduction 1: 541
finish                                    # option 0, no room for the skin: not begun
free-inventory
quest Sandoria.GraveConcerns accepted
warp 1.0,-1.4,-102.0 KingRanperresTomb
fill-inventory
trigger Tombstone_Upper                   # no skin, no waterskin, OfferingWaterOK 0: DroppedWaterskin 1; 2
finish                                    # Dropped 1, no skin, no room: no waterskin
free-inventory
trigger Tombstone_Upper                   # 2 again
finish                                    # the Tomb Guard's Waterskin
warp -276.0,-4.6,118.8 SouthernSanDoria
fill-inventory
trade Well TombGuardsWaterskin x1         # no skin, the waterskin, no room for the skin: nothing taken
free-inventory
trade Well TombGuardsWaterskin x1         # the Skin of Well Water; the waterskin taken
warp 1.0,-1.4,-102.0 KingRanperresTomb
fill-inventory
trade Tombstone_Upper SkinOfWellWater x1  # OfferingWaterOK 0, no room for the waterskin: nil; the skin kept
free-inventory
trade Tombstone_Upper SkinOfWellWater x1  # the waterskin; OfferingWaterOK 1; CHANGE_WATER
warp 171.1,-0.9,45.0 SouthernSanDoria
fill-inventory
trade Andecia TombGuardsWaterskin x1      # OfferingWaterOK 1, DroppedWaterskin 1: 624
finish                                   # no item in the reward: completed even with no room; the waterskin taken
